    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a hero setting out to date a girl, whom you met online, traveling to the distant, unknown small town of Camomile Peaks. But not everything is as it seems, and soon enough, you'll find yourself in the middle of dark secrets and uncovered mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your stay in Camomile Peaks you're most likely to experience:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unraveling murder mysteries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solving puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QTEs and various minigames</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighting enemies and facing your fears</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buying useful (and questionable) items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of dialogues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >True love (probably)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full three-act story: Setup, Confrontation, and Resolution</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making friends along the way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cat!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a hero setting out to date a girl, whom you met online, traveling to the distant, unknown small town of Camomile Peaks. But not everything is as it seems, and soon enough, you'll find yourself in the middle of dark secrets and uncovered mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your stay in Camomile Peaks you're most likely to experience:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unraveling murder mysteries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solving puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QTEs and various minigames</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighting enemies and facing your fears</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buying useful (and questionable) items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of dialogues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >True love (probably)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full three-act story: Setup, Confrontation, and Resolution</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making friends along the way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cat!</p></li></ul>",
